  a list called 'the waybill' is cupboard's "the contents",
  If 'the waybill's length is not 2 then, Print "ASSERT LST-52: expected 2 got {'the waybill's length}", Exit 95. Print 'the waybill's length,
  If element 1 of 'the waybill' is not 9223372036854775807 then, Print "ASSERT LST-52: expected 9223372036854775807 got {element 1 of 'the waybill'}", Exit 95. Print element 1 of 'the waybill',
  If element 2 of 'the waybill' is not 51032 then, Print "ASSERT LST-52: expected 51032 got {element 2 of 'the waybill'}", Exit 95. Print element 2 of 'the waybill',
  a map called 'the message slip' is cupboard's "the reply",
  If 'the message slip's length is not 1 then, Print "ASSERT LST-52: expected 1 got {'the message slip's length}", Exit 95. Print 'the message slip's length,
  a number called 'the message slip inner value seen' is 'the message slip's "leftover",
  If 'the message slip inner value seen' is not 576 then, Print "ASSERT LST-52: expected 576 got {'the message slip inner value seen'}", Exit 95. Print 'the message slip inner value seen'.

