--- LST-67: the position-loop guard idiom, arithmetic on the guarded element ---
a list called cupboard is ["the receipt the returned thing the slot", 91, 0.000000000000000000001].
a number called 'cupboard guarded value' is 0.
If element 2 of cupboard is a number then, Set 'cupboard guarded value' to element 2 of cupboard add 1.
If 'cupboard guarded value' is not 92 then, Print "ASSERT LST-67: expected 92 got {'cupboard guarded value'}", Exit 95. Print 'cupboard guarded value'.

